# Liliana of the Veil's +1: "Each player discards a card." Each player chooses their own card, the player whose turn it
# is first (ruling 2022-09-09): Bot1 picks its Mountain over its Islands and Forest, Bot2 discards one of its own, and
# Liliana goes from 3 loyalty to 4.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp x3
Liliana of the Veil
Island
Mountain
Forest
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x22

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#3.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Liliana of the Veil.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Liliana of the Veil.Activate(Ability: Each player)
Bot1.Choose(Mountain)

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Liliana of the Veil.Counters.Loyalty = 4
Bot1.Graveyard = Mountain
